          <groundspeak:date>2016-07-08T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="946600">Black Shark</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP304 Irma&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The handy railway access was appreciated for pulling off the highway.  As we scanned the various marker posts we spotted the BCP guide post close to a patch of Brown-eyed Susans and hoped we wouldn't have to disturb them to find the cap.  Fortunately, a divot was found between two nearby wood lathes and a small amount of sand removal revealed a cap with only minor marks.  A quick brush off, photos, photos of flowers and we were off.  Thanks for the BCP.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
